Z||000009||rogergarrison||08-14-2001||08:04 AM||||yes, like i said, below the coil, in the upper left portion of the head. sensor for gauge/lite. I think it takes a deep 22mm socket, but not sure. Its rite above the connection to exhaust manifold/crossover pipe, below the engine lifting point eye. ||||reg||1
